stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: manager creates
    Draft --> Active: first assignment commits
    Active --> Active: more members or viewers change
    Active --> Closed: final member removal commits
    Draft --> Closed: user closes draft
    Closed --> Active: reopen and assign commits
    Closed --> [*]: explicit delete
    note right of Active
      Browser disconnect, process recovery,
      and server shutdown preserve membership.
    end note
